OTOGAKURE FIELD MANUAL
DISTRIBUTION: CURSE-SEAL BEARERS (LEVEL 1 CLEARED)
Scroll Ref: KJ-CM-001

SUBJECT: Cursed Seal — Activation and Use

The Cursed Seal (Ten no Juin / Chi no Juin) is a gift and a leash. It draws on Lord
Orochimaru's chakra to flood the bearer with power. Understand its stages before you
rely on it in the field.

Stages
- Dormant: the seal rests. No drain, no augmentation.
- Level 1: the seal-pattern spreads across the skin. Chakra output rises sharply; pain
  and aggression accompany activation. Most bearers stabilize here with training.
- Level 2: full transformation. Physical form is altered. Power is greatly increased but
  the mind is pushed toward Lord Orochimaru's influence. Do not enter Level 2 without
  authorization.

Activation Discipline
1. Steady your breathing; the seal feeds on emotional surge but is governed by will.
2. Draw only the level you can control. Over-draw invites the seal to consume you.
3. Withdraw and reseal the moment the mission permits. Prolonged use accelerates bodily
   degradation (see medical monitoring records).

Reminder
Roughly one in ten survive application of the seal. You survived. That survival is owed
to Lord Orochimaru, and so are you.
